<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">Lamma</book>
  <para style="h">Kolosiyayi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bulus sẽkoo yɛnɛ shɔ Kolosiyawayi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kolosiyayi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kol</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bulus sẽkoo yɛnɛ shɔ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kolosiyayi</para>
  <para style="imt">Yutasinɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Bulus sẽkoo yɛnɛ shɔ Kolosiyayi </char>shɔ beeri shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a Kolosa, komoo au Asiya ujaa aka gɨnri Efisu. Si ɓa Bulus ɓeli wɛrɛ Ɗaurɛ ɓa, ama si a ɗɔu Bulus zɛnaa pɛn vishonɛ, naa sho shɔvishoyinɛtɛ yɛnɛ Efisu, komoo Roma a tipi Asiya pɛ̃niba. Bulus ntanyanɛ shomala nyalinɛ wɔyi si a wɛrɛ Ɗa a Kolosiya i shanɛ shɔu kɛ tɔnɛ nɛn kasi Ɗa ruubii zɛnɛ, u kpaa naraanɛ ɔtɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u bassi &lt;&lt;shɔ wɛrɛ rãmayi a yupɛ̃niyi.&gt;&gt; Shɔmala nyayeliwi sha sɔ̃nɛ, ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ shɔu gɨn ruu shaayɛnɛtɔ shɔu gɨn nyaãsinɛ aru vishaanɛ a viwɔyinitɔ</para>
  <para style="ip">Bulus bee vim aru u noo shɔmala nyayelinɛyi vimatinɛm a Kirisayi vimatinɛ tɔ̃vɨn. U nyarisinɛ gaanɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ nɛ Yesɔ Kirisi zɛnɔɔ shɔ raanɛtɔ, gãsi sisɨn ãnɛ a vishonɛ wɔmiyi i n ti shɔ Yesɔ Kirisi ɗɔbii ɓa. Aka Kirisi kɔ Ɗalapa shɛshi kotipi rɛ, au kabiikɔ u ɗɔu gɔ̃yiyɛ yɛnɛu ɗɔbii. Ji aka yuɓasinɛ a Kirisi kɔ sheeli kotipi u sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ aɗɔn. Bulus tasi yukɔnɛ a vimatinɛ nyayelinɛm yɛ ntiyɛtɔ a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi ɔ̃nɛni.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃tɛ vɨtɔvɨng Tasikus shɔu tusi Bulus sẽkoom yɛnɛ Kolosa, Onesimu u dɔ̃u dɔɔtɔ, foo a Bulus bee vi au yuuyɛ <char style="bk">Pilimon</char>.</para>
  <para style="iot">Vi au Ɓuzɨn yɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Yutasinɛ (1.1-8)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kirisi nyaba vishonɛ (1.9-2.19)</para>
  <para style="io1">Suru sɔɔ a Kirisi (2.20-4.6)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yisinɛ (4.7-18)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="m">Vitasinɛ ip Bulusi Sẽko yɛnɛ shɔ Kolosiyawayi bi, shɔ bee si yɛnɛ shɔ Kolosiyayi bi, a koomɔɔ gbete a jaa kaa gɨnri Afisawayi.Wɛrɛ Ɗami si ɓa gbete Bulus ɓɛliyɛ ɓa, ama si a ɗɔgbete Bulus shovi aɗɔnyɛ, naa sho shɔ vishonɛyitɛ a Afisawayi, shɔ Roomayi gaanɛ ɗɔɔ a tipi Asiya. Bulus ntarɛ nɛ shɔmala nyazɔ̃yi i a wɛrɛ Ɗa a Kolosiyawayi tipi aɗɔgbete i bɔ̃ɔ shɔyɛ nɛ shɔukɛ tɔnɛ nɛn kasi Ɗa zɛnɛ u kpaa raanɛ ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ shɔu gɨn vi lansi a shɔgbete i roo kpati a suruyɛ a shɔ kakayi. Shɔmalawi i sha wɔsɔ̃nɛ, ɔ̃ri ko-piyatɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ u gɨn nya ãsinɛ shaa yeenɛtɔ, nɛ ɔ̃ri shɔ wɔsɔ̃ntɛ nɛ shɔu gɨn nya ãsinɛ aru vishanɛyi a nya ãsinɛ gãsiyini. ip Bulusi bee vim aru gbete nɛn yisi yi nyazɔ̃ pɛ a Ɗalapa nyaruubii. Ruugbete shɛ au sisɨn yɛ nɛ Yesɔ Kirisikɔ yɛ ã shɔ naa raanɛrɛ, a shɔ gɨnnɛ gãsiyi shɔ ɗakiyiɓa i yau nyaba ɓam. A Kirisi kabiikɔ, Ɗalapa kɔri koorɛ, sɔ̃njo au kabiikɔ yɛ sɔri koo sɔ̃njo au ɗɔɔbii. Jo a kaa yuuɓasinɛ a Kirisini i pɔ̃nɛ sisɨnrɛ nɛ shɔ yɛ kpaa naa raanɛrɛ a koo. Bulusi shɛshi vigbete yɛ n ti yuu kɔnɛ pẽnɛba a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi tete ai ɔ̃nɛni. ip Ji kɔriɓa nɛ Tishikusi shɔgbete au tuu sẽkom a tipi Kolosiyawayi a n ti Bulus rɛ, ji kɔriɓa nɛ Onesimu kɔ si dɔ̃u dɔɔrɛ ɓa aruviya u sipɛ jafoo gbete Bulusi bee vi au yuuyɛ Filimon. iot Vigbete a ɓuzɨnyɛ Vitasinɛ Nogbete Kirisi vishonɛ sãyɛ 2.19) Suru sɔɔ gbete a Kirisi biiyɛ Yisinɛ.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Sẽkoom shɛ a Bulus shɔgbete Ɗalapa kasirɛ nɛu ɔ̃ Kirisi Yesɔ jashonɛ au ɓɛzɔ̃ Timoti naa<verse eid="COL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />yɛnɛ Ɗalapa shɔbiiyi a komoo Kolosiya, shɔgbeteyi pɛ u ɓesa sisɨn ãnɛ aka yuɓasinɛ a Kirisini:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">Mɛnɛ Ɗalapa u Ɓeye u ãwɔ tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ a ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛni.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗa Gakinɛ Dɔ̃rinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />U dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa tɔ kopiɗaviya, naa ukɛ gaki Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi Ɓeye nɛ awɔ yuuni. <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />Aruviya u ntawɔ ruu sisɨn ãnɛ tɛttɔ a Kirisi Yesɔ biini, awɔ ɔrinɛ gbete ɔ tasi Ɗalapa shɔbiiyini kpai. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Aɗagbete Ɗalapa nyaruubii, ruu tɔ̃vɨn, au gaa wɔ ɗɔbii anɛyɛ, ɔ nta ruu sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ gbete a ã shoyɛtɛttɔ. Aru nankɔ ɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a ɔrinɛni shi ayuu vigbete ɔ pɔ̃ sisɨn aɗɔnyɛ, shɔ pɔ̃sɔɔtɛttɔ kaali a kolapa. <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />Ruu tɔ̃vɨnmiyi au awɔ ɗɔbi sãti a koo kpai u ɗɔgbeteu n ti Ɗa susãri tasinɛ a shɔ abi, ji nagbete au pɛli si awɔ teteyɛ, yunɛ aɗagbete ɔ nta Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ anɛ aɗagbete ɔ zɛ nɔgbete ɔ̃yɛni. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Ɔ nta Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ a Ipafarasi nya, u jawɛrɛ au ɔriyɛ, shɔgbete au shoshi Kirisi vi a sisɨn gbete, aruviya u pɛ u janɔɔ. <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />Ukɔ geliurɛ nɛ Ɗa Suru ãwɔ zɔ ɔrinɛrɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Aruukɔ sãnɛ aɗagbete u ntawɔ ruubiiyɛ, kopiɗaviya u gaki Ɗalapa tɔ awɔ yuuni, U gaki Ɗalapa u ãwɔ u vizɛnɛ au vishonɛni, a sẽrẽ vizɛnɛ gbete u Suru ã shɔyɛ kpaini. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Kɛɗɔn ɔ zɛnɔɔ ɔ̃nɛtɔ nagbete Uɓeyelapa kasiyɛni, ɔ pɛli vigbete kasiyɛ kopiɗaviya, ɔ ɔ̃nɛ yɛ n ti zɔn vitɔ̃vɨng gbete ɔ pɛliyɛtɔ kpai, ɔ banɛ yɛ ɔ̃ atette Ɗalapa ruuzɛnɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />U gaki Ɗa mɛnɛ ɔ lakikɔɔtɔ piti a kaka gbete shɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbiiyɛ, nɔgbete ɔ zɛnɔɔ sisɨnmɛnɛ a vigbete yɛ kpayɛni kpai a sisɨn puru <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />a dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa Uɓeyelapatɔ, shɔgbete au sɨwɔrɛ ɔ kpaa vigbete Ɗalapa pɔ̃si ɓɛshɔzɛyi au ɗɔɔ kpati roonɛ sẽsẽni. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />A raurɛ a kpati ɗɔkɨnri naani a n-tiurɛ a ɗɔgbete u jaa ɔrinɛ roo kpatiyɛ, <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />au kabiikɔ u kpaa raanɛrɛ, kɛu ruuvini yaasinɛ.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pi Ɔ̃rɛ Kirisi Piya Au Vishonɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Kirisi shɔgbete u zɛu au nɔɔyɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ jasuru Ɗalapa gbete shɔ zɛuɓayɛ. Ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ jaamari vɔshɔ, au tɛɛ vigbete Ɗalapa shɛshiyɛtɛ kpai . <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />aruviya au kaa bikɔ Ɗalapa shɛshi vi a kolapa a kotipini kpai, vigbete a shɔ zɛyɛ a vigbete shɔ zɛɓayɛni kpai, piti a suru kakayini, jaɗayi kaka, a kpatiyi kakani. Ɗalapa shɛshi koo piti kpai au kabiikɔ au ruu yuukɔ. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Vipiti kpai i ɓɛɛ ɔ̃nɛ Kirisikɔ gaa ɔ̃nɛrɛ, aka yuɓasinɛ a ukɔni vigbete Ɗalapa shɛshiyɛ i kpaa ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨnrɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Kirisi ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ yupɛ̃ni gbete sã shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi, ji nagbete yuu sã jazɛbii piti kpaiyɛ, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ jamari vɔshɔ au yuu a saa a suruni, aruviya a vipiti kpai ukɔu ɔ̃rɛ a ɗekɨn. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Aru Ɗalapa au yuu marɛ nɛn jaa kɔ yɛ ɔ̃ Ɗalapa shẽẽbiirɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />Aru nankɔ a ɓɛɛ jaa kabiikɔ Ɗalapa n ti vigbete shɛshiyɛ kpai au ɗɔbii. Ɗalapa n ti ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ aka ɓɛɛ jaa kpaa gbete ntee a laa gbete shɔ ɓaunaa aɗɔnyɛ, kɛɗɔn sɔri vigbete shɛshiyɛ au ɗɔbii kpai, vigbete a kolapa a vigbete kotipini. <verse eid="COL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />A ɗagbete ɔsi kpɛlɛ a Ɗalapani ɔ sipɛ u shɔ nɔpɔ̃ɔ aru vikɔ̃linɛ gbete ɔ pɛliyɛ awɔ mati shɔyɛni. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Ama dɔdɔrim aka ɓɛɛ jaa vɔnɛ jazebiiyɛ, Ɗalapa pɔ̃wɔɔtɛ ɔ ritɛ ɓɛusayi, aru u pɔ̃rɛ ɔ ɔ̃ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ, ɔ̃ wasak wɔsɔ̃n ɔ ɔ̃ ɓa a ruuvinini au ɗekɨn ni ɓa. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ, ɔ shi dɔkaziti awɔ sisɨn ãnɛmni, ɔ̃rɔɔ sɔ̃ntɛ kaka jazɨng awɔ kɔrɔ ɔkɔɔ guli biinɛ a sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ gbete ɔ kpaayɛ aɗagbete ɔ nta ruu tɔ̃vɨn yɛni. Si jo aru ruu tɔ̃vɨnkɔ n biba Bulus n ɔ̃ jawɛrɛrɛ. Shom jo ruu tɔ̃vɨn gbete shɔ nwari ko-piya tɛttɔ kopiɗɔpiya a koo.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus Pɛli Vishonɛ Naa Shɔ sisɨn Ãnɛ Jawɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Dɔdɔrim n nta sisɨn purutɛ ayuu n raaɓoonɛ awɔ yuuni, a nyaba n raaboonɛ jazebiimkɔ, n pɔ̃naatɛ n yisinya vigbete yaa atette Kirisi raaboonɛ au nɔɔbii, kɛ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Ɗalapa risinkɛtɛ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi, ukɔ ãng vishonɛrɛ nɛn pɛli awɔ yuu. pɛ vishonɛ gbete shɔ nwari shɔ Ɗanyaruubiiyɛ, <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />Pɛ ruuɓusinɛ gbete au ɓusi shɔ laduru kɨntiyɛ ama tasiu shɔbiiyi dɔdɔrim tɛ kpai. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Ɗalapa marɛ nɛn tasi u ruuɓusinɛ u shɔbiiyi zɛtɔ, ruuɓusinɛm pɛ vi pɛ̃niba gbete au ɓusiyɛ nɛn tasi shɔ kpai. Ruuɓusinɛm ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Kirisi gbete awɔ biiyɛ, vim tasitɛ nɛ ɔ yɛ kpaa Ɗalapa basinɛtɔ. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Aruukɔ u nwari kopiya Kirisi nyaruubiirɛ. U gɔ̃ shɔ yushotɔ u matiyi vi a sẽrẽ gbete u a wuniyɛ kpai, u pɛli vim aru shɔgbete i kɛ ɓasiyunɛ a Kirisini kpai, i kpaa kaka i ɔ̃ a suruni naa u kɛ n tinɛ Ɗalapa ɗekɨn yɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />N ɓɛɛ vim kpaanɛ n pɛli vishonɛtɔ a ɗɔɔ nwanɛni, n shovi a kaka pɛ̃niba gbete Kirisi ãngyɛ au a ɗɔɔ vishonɛ ang biiyɛ.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />N kasirɛ ɔ zɛ nɔgbete n pɛli vishonɛ awɔ yuu a shɔ tipi Lawudikiyani a gãsiyi shɔgbete i jo zɛn ɓayɛni kpai. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />N pɛli vim aru gbete i mabii i ɓasiyuu ɗɔɔzɔ a yɛti ɔrinɛ, i kpaa bilakinɛ ai sisɨn, i kpaa wɔsɔ̃n ruu tɔ̃vɨn zɛnɛ waanɛ. A nyabankɔ i yɛ zɛ Ɗalapa viɓusinɛtɔ, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Kirisi au yuu. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Kirisi ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ saa nyejaa gbete shɔ ɓeli nyejaa a Ɗalapa ɓusi sẽrẽ a vizɛnɛni aɗɔnyɛ piti kpai.<verse eid="COL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />N gelɔɔtɛ, ɔkɔɔ yaa shɔwɔnɛ u ɗakɔɔrɛ a ruu nyamasinɛ kɔ̃linɛ wɔɔni, ko i ruu kɔri naa iviya. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Ko a jazɛbii n ɓa ɔkɔɔni ɓa, ama n a ɔkɔɔni a suru, n ntabiinyatɔ̃nɛtɛ fɛ̃ɛm aru gbete ɔ shiɗɔɔkaziti atette sisɨn ãnɛ a Kirisi biini.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃nɛ Sɔɔ a Kirisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Nɔgbete ɔ tɛ Kirisi Yesɔtɛ gboti nɛu pɛ Uɓeyelapa, ɔ ɔ̃ atette yuɓasinɛ awuni. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Ɔ yɛ ɗekɨn a sisɨn ãnɛni fɛ̃ɛm a Kirisi yuuni, vigbete ɓasɔɔ a Kirisini u kaka u ɔ̃ ɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm, ɔ kaka u lakitɔ awɔ sisɨn ãnɛni fɛ̃ɛm nagbete shɔ matɔyɛ. Kopiɗaviya ɔ ɔ̃ shɔ Ɗalapa dɔ̃rinɛ.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Ɔ kobiitɔ, shɔwɔkɔ shɔlɔɔnɛ a shɔzɛ sẽrẽ kotipimni, gbete i vimatinɛ shɛ a shɔzɛ naa a suru kotipimyi i kaka, ɓa gbete shɛ a Kirisi naa ɓa. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Aruviya Kirisi ɓɛɛ ɔ̃nɛ bishɔzɛ, u si ɓɛɛ jo Ɗalapa, <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />Ɗalapa ãwɔ ɔ̃nɛtɛ ɓasɔɔtɛ a Kirisini. Ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ kpati au sã suru gãsiyiyɛ piti kpai a shɔ kakayini.<verse eid="COL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Aka yuɓasinɛ a Kirisini shɔ yeerɔɔ shaarɛ, ɓa shaa gbete shɔzɛ yeeyɛ ɓa, ama pɛ shaa gbete Kirisi yeeri shɔyɛ, a nyaba gbete shɔ raawɔ a ruuviniyɛ. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Aruviya shɔkɛ pɛlɔɔ batizima nɛ si shɔ gbãwɔɔtɛ a Kirisini nyazɔ, aka batizima kɔ shɔ yusɔɔ laparɛ a Kirisini a nyaba sisɨn ãnɛ a Ɗalapa kaka vishonɛ, shɔgbete yusiu a saa yɛ. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Si ɔ vɔtɛttɔ a suru aru ɔ ruuviniyi wɔsɔ̃n aru gbete ɔ siɓa shɔ Yahudawayi ɓa, si ɔ ji zɛ Musa nya ãsinɛ ɓa. Ama dɔdɔrim Ɗalapa shɛshɔtɛ a suruni a Kirisi kabii. Ɗalapa yaasiu ruuvinitɛ kpai; <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />ukɔ sɔ̃riu vikɔ̃linɛ gbete shɔ bee au yuu a ruu gbete sãuyɛni kpai, ɓasitɛ ɓaatɛ a laa dangdang. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Ji laa wakɔ Kirisi rau yuurɛ a kpati suru kɔ̃linɛyi kaka a kaka gbete i sã shɔyɛni; a tasi kopiya nɛn tɛɛyi kakatɛ a nyaba gbete Kirisi vɔ a yulaayɛ.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Aru nankɔ ɔkɔɔ yaa shɔwɔnɛ u yeeruu aru vigbete ɔ shaayɛ ko vigbete ɔ ɓooyɛ ko ayuu dii wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ ko ayuu lee yumusinɛ a shɛlɛ sɔɔ ko lee susunɛ. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Vim kpai pɛ jasuru vigbete a ɗekɨn yɛ; Kirisikɔ ɔ̃rɛ vinizɛ. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Ɔkɔɔ yaa shɔwɔyinɛ i tasiyi yuu nɛyi pɛ̃niba i nyowɔ ruurɛ nɛ ɔ rooriyuu ɔ bassi ɗajashonɛyi, shɔmiyi i shanɛli nɛyi zɛvi ɗekɨntɔ i yeeli shɔ nya nɛyi shɔ yuuroorinɛ i kã bɛlinɛ a shɔzɛ ɗekɨn. I bassi yuu ji weze, shɔmiyi kpai i tuu ɓɛɛ jo lɛrinɛ shɔzɛ kotipiyi <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />i yaa sisɨn ãnɛtɛ a Kirisi biini, shɔgbete ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ yuu a bi. Pɛ Kirisikɔ pɔ̃u birɛ kpai i barɛ a suru, ji nagbete yuu pɔ̃ bi bayɛ, ukɔ ɓasi bi aka gboki a rɨti i bakɛkɨn nagbete Ɗalapa kasi nɛu bayɛ.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vɔnɛ a Ɔ̃nɛ a Kirisini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Ɔ vɔtɛ a Kirisini, aru nankɔ ɔ kpaa naraanɛtɛ a suru gbete roo kpati a tipimyɛni. A ɔ̃ kɛpikovi naa shɔzɛ kotipi viya? Ɔ gɨn nya ãsinɛ kotipim piruuviya <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />&lt;&lt;Ɔkɔɔ sã vimnɛ,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt; Ɔkɔɔ mati viwaanɛ,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ɔkɔɔ ɗii viwɔnɛ&gt;&gt;? <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Vim piti kpai tasikɛ vigbete ɔ̃tɛ vishonɛ ɓa naa shɔkɛ shovinɛ a wuniyɛ; i pɛ shɔzɛ nya ãsinɛ sheeli a vimatinɛni. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Pɛ nizɛ, nya ãsinɛm shɛ ɓɛɛjo a sẽrẽ gbete pɔ̃ shɔu ɔri Ɗalapa fɛ̃ɛm, u pɔ̃ shɔ i rooriyuu, shɔ sã yuu ɗɔɔtɔ. ama pɛnizɛ i vishonɛ kaka gbete yɛ zãri shɔ vi jazɛbii ɓa.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Asitɛɗɔkɔ a yulapatɛ a suru a Kirisini, ɔ pɔ̃wɔ sisɨn a vigbete a kolapa, a ɗɔgbete Kirisi ɔ̃ au laakpati a Ɗalapa ka nakɨn. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Ɔ pɔ̃ sisɨn a vigbete a lapa, ɓa vigbete a kotipim yɛ ɓa. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Aruviya ɔ vɔtɛttɔ, a dɔdɔrim ɔ suru a ɗɔɓusinɛ Kirisini a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Ɔ suru gaanɛ pɛ Kirisi. Naa kɛ shɛnɛ, kɛɗɔn ɔkɔɔma ɔ yɛ shɛjo awuni ɔ kpau basinɛ jo!<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Suru Gbaali a Suru Sɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ ɔ nyɔ vigbete ɔ ɔri a kotipimtɔ, roonɛ a so ko vɔshɔ gbete ɓa a ɓɛɛ ɓa, fãrã tosinɛ kɔ̃linɛ, kpãntang pɛlinɛ, vikɔ̃linɛ gbete shɔzɛ yɛti kasiyɛ, a nɔɔ taanɛ shɔvi (nɔɔ taanɛ ɔ̃tɛ naa vigbete i suru ɓa i basinɛ). <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Aru vimiyikɔ Ɗalapa yɛti lɛsinɛ yɛ nɔɔ a shɔgbeteyi jo gɨu nyaɓayɛ i yuu. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />A ɗawakɔ ɔ ɔ̃ si jo namkɔ a yɛti vigbete ɔ sisɨn kasiyɛ, si akɨnti ɔ ɔ̃nɛ si jo naayi ɓɛɛkɔ<verse eid="COL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Ama dɔdɔrim ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔɔ ɔ yaa vimtɔ kpai: sisɨn lɛsinɛ, sisɨn lanɛ, sisɨn shɔ bɛ̃ɛ̃nɛ. Zɔ dãnɛ ko zɔ nii lɛsinɛ ukɔ shɛnɛ toti awɔ nyani. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Ɔkɔɔ yeeli zɔnyanɛ a yuuni, aru ɔ yaa vi gbaali pɛlinɛtɛ gboti au vishonɛni <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />ɔ tosi dɔdɔrim kɛtɛ vi sɔɔ. N pɛ vi sɔɔ gbete Ɗalapa shɛshiyɛ, ko-pi lee piya u ɗɔ kɔsi au jasuru, aru u sɨuwɔɔrɛ ɔ zɛutɔ fɛ̃ɛm nɔgbete ɔ̃yɛ. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Aru nankɔ shɔvɔsi dɔɔɓa nɛ shompɛ Yahudawa ko ɓa Yahudawa ɓa, shɔgbete shɔ yeeriu shaatɛ ko shɔgbete shɔ ji yeeriu shaa ɓa, shɔ zati, ko shɔ jaalaayi ko foo, ko shɔgbete i ɓa foo ɓa, ama Kirisi ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ i piti kpai a ko iviya kpai.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Ɔ pɛ Ɗalapa ɓɛshɔzɛyi; ukɔɔ ɔrɔɔrɛ a lɔɔrɛ nɛ ɔ ɔ̃ u ɓɛɛ. Aru nankɔ ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ ɔ ntazɔ raatɔ, ɔ rooriyuutɔ, ɔ pɛli shɔgbete i ɗɔɔraa ɓoonɛ vitɔ̃vɨng, ɔkɔɔ tuu yuunɛ ɔ mɛsisɨntɔ a zɔni. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Ɔkɔɔ sã zɔnɛ a sisɨnni, ɔ yaasi zɔ ruuvinitɔ, naa ɔkɛ kpaa yuu yɔrinɛnɛ a zɔni ko-pi ɗaviya, ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ ɔ yaasi zɔ ruuvinitɔ nagbete Uɓeyelapa yasɔɔ yɛ. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Vigbete au tɛɛ vimiyi kpai ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ zɔ ɔrinɛ, ukɔɔ ɓasi vimiyi yuurɛ ɗɔgbete kpai dangdang. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ gbete Kirisi ãwɔyɛ pɛ aru u tasɔɔ nyaba vigbete ɔ pɛliyɛ; si jo aru ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛmkɔ Ɗalapa ɓawɔɔ nya nɛ ɔ ɔ̃ gbete. Nɛ ɔ ɔ̃ shɔ dɔ̃rinɛ kopiɗaviya. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ Kirisi nyaruubii u ɔ̃ awɔ sisɨn fɛ̃ɛm. Ɔ mati zɔ vitɔ, ɔ kosi zɔ nyatɔ a sẽrẽ gbete ɔ a wuniyɛ . Ɔ ntɔɔ soo Zaburatɔ a soo Ɗalapa nii bɛlinɛni a soo gbete Ɗasuru ãwɔyɛ; ɔ ntɔɔri Ɗalapa soo dɔ̃rinɛtɔ awɔ sisɨnni. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Vigbete ɔkɛ pɛlinɛ ko shanɛ kpai u ɔ̃ jo a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ nii, nagbete ɔ ã dɔ̃rinɛ au kabii yɛnɛ u Ɓeye Ɗalapa bi.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn a Tete Suru Sɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Suwɛrɛyi, ɔ ãyuu a mɛvɔyi bi, aru shɔm ɓɛɛ ji vigbete ɔyɛ pɛli naa Kirisayiyɛ.<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Shɔ yuwɛrɛyi ɔ ɔri mɛsoyitɔ ɔkɔɔ lasisɨnnɛ ayini.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Jaayi kopiɗaviya ɔ gɨn meyeyi nyatɔ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ ɔ vishonɛ kirisita, n pɛ vigbete u Ɗalapa kasiyɛ.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Ɔ ɓeye a ɓini ɔkɔɔ ɓɔ̃ɔ mɛjaayinɛ, aruviya iyɛ zɔ̃ sisɨnrɛ awɔ biini.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Fooyi ɔ gɨn ɔ shɔwɛrɛyi kotipi nyatɔ a yuu vi piti kpai, ɓanɛ aru gbete i awɔ ɗɔɔ zɛnɛkɔ sheeli ɓa, ɔkɔɔ pɛlinɛ aru ɔ kasi nɛi nta tɔ̃vɨn a ɔkɔɔni sheeli ɓa; ɔ pɛli a sisɨn gbete aru Uɓeyelapa nyaba seti ntanɛ. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Vigbete ɔkɛ pɛlinɛ kpai ɔ pɛlitɔ a sisɨn gbete, nagbete ɔ pɛli Uɓeyelapayɛ ɓa shɔzɛ ɓa. <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />Ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ nɛ Uɓeyelapa yɛ ãwɔ viɗɔnwanɛtɔ gbete au pɔ̃si ɓɛshɔzɛyiyɛtɔ. Aruviya Kirisi ukɔ pɛ ɔ shɔwɛrɛ gaanɛ gbete ɔ shoshiu viyɛ. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Shɔgbeteyi pɛli vikɔ̃linɛ yɛ kpai shɔyɛ shoriyi vidɔnwanɛ jo a vikɔ̃linɛ ai pɛliyɛkɔ, aruviya Ɗalapa yeeri kopiya ruu jo naa gbete kpai.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Shɔwɛrɛyi ɔ sã ɔ fooyi jo sisɨn gbete atette tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ. Ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ nɛ ɔ shɔwɛrɛ ji ɗɔn a kolapa.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyakɔsinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Ɔ yɛ ɗekɨn a Ɗa gakinɛni, ɔ shi dɔkaziti a ɗɔɔ Ɗa gakinɛ au dɔ̃rinɛni. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Sɔ̃njo nankɔ ɔ gakiu Ɗa jo nɔgbete Ɗalapa yɛ ɓeliu nyaba tɔ̃vɨn u nwa u ruubii ayuu ruuɓusinɛ a Kirisi yuu. Aruukɔ dɔdɔtrim n a jahm. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Ɔ gaking Ɗatɔ anɔgbete n yɛn nwanya nagbete n kasi nwanɛyɛ, a nyaba gbete n yɛn zɛnɔɔ shɔ ruu tasinɛ wasa-wasa.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Ɔ ɔ̃ shɔ ruu kpẽnɛ a nyaba gbete ɔ pɛli viyɛ a shɔgbeteyi ɓa shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi ɓani, ɔ kɛ kpaa nyaba nɛ ɔ shovi tɔ̃vɨntɔ awuni. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Ɔ nyanwanɛ u ntɔtɔ a shɔ shoni kopiɗaviya gbete au gɔ̃ shɔ yuuyɛni, nɔgbete ɔ yɛ zɛnɔɔ kopiya nya kasinɛyɛ.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyageenɛ Dangdang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Tishiku u wesa gbete u ɔriu fɛ̃ɛm, shɔgbete shoshiu Uɓeyelapa vishonɛ sisɨn gbete yɛ, ukɔ yɛ gelɔɔ ruurɛ ang yuuni kpai. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Aru gbetenkɔ n shourɛ awɔ ɗɔbiini, nɔgbete u masɔɔ bi a vigbete u a ɓuzɨnniyɛ. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Kaanɛ Onisimuni, u wesa ɔrinɛ gbete shovi sisɨn gbeteyɛ, shɔgbete u awɔ kɨn, I yɛ gelɔɔ vigbete aɗɔ yɛnɛ a aɗɔm kpai.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Aritaku gbete u a jahɨm a nkɔniyɛ, geewɔɔ nyatɛ jo a Marikusi gbete i ɓɛtara gbete a Barnaba ni. N kosɔɔ nyatɛtɔ nɔgbete ɔyɛ tɛ Marikusi naayɛni nɗa kaanɛ awɔ ɗɔbiiyɛ. <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Yoshuwa gbete shɔ ɓaunɛ Yositu ukɔ ma geewɔɔ nyatɛ jo. Atette Yahudawa gbete ai ã sisɨn yɛ, shɔzɛ taati miyi ikɔyi shovirɛ ang nkɔni aru Ɗa lakpati roonɛ, i pɔ̃sinnaatɔ fɛ̃ɛm ang vishonɛni. <verse eid="COL 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Ipafarasi gee ɔ nyatɛ, pɛ jo ɔ jaa kn wɔɔkɔ, u Kirisi Yesɔ jawɛrɛ. Kopiɗaviya yɔriyuutɔ awɔ yuuni fɛ̃ɛm, u aɗɔgbete gaki Ɗayɛ, u ɗɔgbete geli Ɗanɛ u ãwɔ kaka tɔ ɔ shi dɔkaziti, naa shɔgbete i nɔɔzɔ̃ tɛttɔ a nyaba Kirisani, nɔgbete a Ɗalapa kasinɛu gɨu nyayɛ. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />N ang yuu n zɛ vishonɛ gbete Iparasi sho awɔ yuu tɛtɔ fɛ̃ɛm ɔ shɔ Laudokiyayi a shɔ Hirapoliyi ni kpai. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Luka, u shɔ gãn ãnɛ ɔrinɛ a Dema i geewɔɔ nyatɛ jo. <verse eid="COL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Ɔ gee shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ gbete i a Laudokiya a Nimfa ni a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ gbeteyi tolinya au wɛrɛyɛni kpai. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />A knti gbete ɔkɛ ɓali sẽkoomnɛ ɔ zɛtɔ ɔ ɓali sɔ̃njo a wɛrɛ Ɗa gbete a Laudokiyani. Sɔ̃njo nankɔ ɔ ɓali sẽkoom gbete shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a Laudokiya i yɛ shɔshɔɔ yɛ sɔ̃njo. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Ɔ geli Ashipu tɔ nɛu, &lt;&lt;Mabiitɔ u yisinya vishonɛ gbete shɔ ãuyɛ nɛu pɛliyɛ a Uɓeyelapa ɗɔ vishonɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="COL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />N bee vimjo ang naa: <char style="sig">Nyageenɛ shɛ a Bulus nya </char>. Ɔkɔɔ sukin saagãnyanɛǃ</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 4:18">Mɛnɛ Ɗalapa vishonɛ tɔ̃vɨn u ɔ̃ a ɔkɔɔni.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>